The fork diverges from upstream commit 18fd5aa (2025-12-16, branch
feat/automacao-experimentos). Changes made in this fork, all after that
commit and visible in the git history:

- experiment runners for the UCC 2026 paper: run_ucc_experiment.sh
  (confirmatory blocks), run_experiment.py, run_one_replica.sh,
  run_replicas.py and smoke_1_replica.py (live experiment);
- a compressed ~10-minute scenario (simulator/data/config_compressed.yaml,
  simulator/data/input_compressed.json) and a per-replica config path
  (SIM_CONFIG_SRC) in compose.yaml and scripts/main.sh;
- a light reset mode between replicas (scripts/light_reset.sh,
  scripts/assert_clean_state.sh);
- the pre-registration of the live experiment (PRE-REGISTRO-workshop.md),
  byte-exact copies of the experiment prompts (prompts-experimento/), and
  the analysis code and data behind the paper (paper/).

The ai-engine submodule points to a fork of
https://github.com/cloud-ai-ufcg/ai-engine (Apache License 2.0) that adds
three commits used by the live experiment; see README.md.
